// Ch8 B07, second half (act1_ch08.md §2 B07; F08_key → W08). Played when the player turns the great
// flue-key in the gallery (the one input). The beacon roars up out of its basket, and down the coast,
// one after another, the bells answer (W08, a long lens from the gallery: the beacon flaring, then the
// bells' lights coming on one by one). Toma: "Down. Now. The stair." Sets ch08_beacon_opened. The
// chapter flow then runs the party back to Corrow's wall-gate in the storm (B08).
title: ch08_beacon_opened
location: ch08/coilspire
---
@letterbox on
@camera F08_key
@anim asha turn_great_key
@sfx beacon_roar
@wait 1.5
@music undertow_rising fade=0.5
@camera W08
@sfx coast_bells
@wait 4.0
<<set $ch08_beacon_opened = true>>
@camera F08
Toma [determined]: Down. Now. The stair. #line:ch08_beacon_opened_001
@mark toma gallery_out run via=way_gallery_door
@wait 0.6
@fade out 0.6
===
